        <p><strong>Monday, August 17, 2026</strong></p>
        <h2>
                <strong>Equity Trader Alert&nbsp;#2026 - 46</strong>
                <br />
                Nasdaq Stock Market: New Trading Hours Effective December 6, 2026
        </h2>
</div> 
                    <div id="MainContainer"><div class="genTableNews" style="color: black; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;">
<table>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 200px; vertical-align: top;">
            <h3 class="title">Category:</h3>
            <ul class="check_hta">
                <li>New Functionality</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 class="title">Markets Impacted:</h3>
            <ul class="check_hta">
                <li><a href="http://nasdaqtrader.com/Trader.aspx?id=TradingUSEquities">The Nasdaq Stock Market (Nasdaq)</a></li>
            </ul>
            <h3 class="title">Contact Information:</h3>
            <ul class="check_hta">
                <li><a href="mailto:sales@nasdaq.com">U.S. Market Sales</a><br>
                +1 800 846 0477</li>
                <li><a href="mailto:tradingservices@nasdaq.com">Nasdaq Trading Services</a><br>
                +1 212 231 5180<a href="mailto:tradingservices@nasdaqomx.com" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; color: #005b7f;"></a></li>
                <li><a href="mailto:tradingservices@nasdaqomx.com" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; color: #005b7f;">U.S. Market Operations</a><br>
                +1 212 231 5180</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 class="title">Resources:</h3>
            <ul class="check_hta" style="font-size: 12px;">
                <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit;"><a href="mailto:tradingservices@nasdaqomx.com" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; color: #005b7f;"></a><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/24-hour-trading-hub">Nasdaq Global Trading Hours Hub</a></li>
                <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit;"><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/24-hour-trading-hub"></a><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/docs/nasdaq-global-trading-hours-faqs">Global Trading Hours FAQ</a></li>
                <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit;"><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/docs/nasdaq-global-trading-hours-faqs"></a><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/docs/global-trading-hours-corporate-actions-faqs"><font face="Arial">Corporate Actions FAQ</font></a></li>
            </ul>
            </th>
            <td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
            <p>
            </p>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">To meet rising demand for U.S. equities across the globe, Nasdaq is engaging with regulators to offer nearly continuous trading 23 hours a day, 5 days a week, on the Nasdaq Stock Market. On December 6, 2026, Nasdaq will introduce a new trading session from 9 p.m. to 4 a.m. ET.</font></p>
            <p><strong><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Order Handling</font></strong></p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Members will need new order entry ports. </font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Routable orders will be accepted. </font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Any orders remaining open at 4 a.m. ET will be cancelled and can be re-entered in the subsequent session.</font></li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Trade Date and Settlement</font></strong></p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Trades executed between 9 p.m. ET and midnight will be assigned the next trading day's trade date.</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Trades executed from midnight through 8 p.m. ET will carry the current day’s trade date.</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Settlement processing will continue to be based on trade date. </font></li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Market Protections</font></strong></p>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Nasdaq will make Equities Risk Checks available through both API and WorkX. &nbsp;In addition, the SEC has now approved a LULD national market system plan amendment requiring, among other things, the exchange’s rejection of orders priced outside certain static price bands disseminated via the securities information processors (SIPs). These bands will be based on the listing market's adjusted Official Closing Price and the adjusted last round-lot sale prior to 7:45 p.m. ET. The proposed upper band will be set 20% above the greater of the two reference prices, while the lower band will be set 20% below the lesser reference price, subject to minimum band widths of $3.00 for securities priced at or above $1.00 and $1.00 for securities priced below $1.00.</font></p>
            <p><strong><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Corporate Actions and Dividends</font></strong></p>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">As described in the Exchange’s rule proposal to become operative on December 6, 2026, certain categories of corporate actions will be halted before 9 p.m. ET on the day immediately preceding the effective date and resumed at 8 a.m. ET on the effective date. Nasdaq will send a Trade Halt Code of ‘M1’ to denote Corporate Action. More information can be found in the </font><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/docs/global-trading-hours-corporate-actions-faqs"><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Corporate Actions FAQ</font></a><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">.</font></p>
            <p><strong><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Client Testing Opportunities</font></strong></p>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Nasdaq Test Facility (NTF)</font></p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif"></font><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">September 1, 2026</font></li>
            </ul>
            <p>Weekend User Acceptance Test (UAT) Schedule</p>
            <ul style="font-size: 12px;">
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;">October 2, 2026</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;">October 16, 2026</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;">October 30, 2026</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;">November 6, 2026</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;">November 20, 2026</font></li>
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;">December 4, 2026</font></li>
            </ul>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Pre-Production Period</font></p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
                <li><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">November 1, 2026</font></li>
            </ul>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Order entry and trading of Nasdaq Test Symbols (ZXZZT, ZVZZT, and ZWZZT) will be available between 9 p.m. and 4 a.m. Market data will be broadcast for Nasdaq Test Symbols during the pre-production period.</font></p>
            <p><strong><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Additional Resources</font></strong></p>
            <p><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">For additional information, please visit the </font><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/24-hour-trading-hub"><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Nasdaq Global Trading Hours Hub</font></a><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">, the </font><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/docs/nasdaq-global-trading-hours-faqs"><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Global Trading Hours FAQ</font></a><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif"> and the </font><a href="https://www.nasdaq.com/docs/global-trading-hours-corporate-actions-faqs"><font style="font-size: 10pt;" face="&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif">Corporate Actions FAQ.</font></a></p>
